ote-3"\:`"Can't beat comfortable clothing at prices that let me stock up in every color I want."`,"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.content-label"\:"Content","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.design-label"\:"Section style","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.fitness-wellness-attribution-1"\:"Toni Ann, 24, Pittsburgh","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.fitness-wellness-attribution-2"\:"Markus, 35, Tucson","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.fitness-wellness-attribution-3"\:"Jenna, 39, Portland","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.fitness-wellness-quote"\:'"These leggings are soft and comfy, but stay in place even on long runs."',"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.fitness-wellness-quote-2"\:'"Never understood what the whole athleisure thing was about\\u2014until now."',"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.fitness-wellness-quote-3"\:`"I like that their designs don't look like everything else on the market. Great price, too."`,"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.food-drink-attribution-1"\:"Tori, 27, Detroit","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.food-drink-attribution-2"\:"Francis, 33, New Orleans","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.food-drink-attribution-3"\:"Emma, 40, San Diego","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.food-drink-quote"\:`"The rich flavors are even more memorable knowing that it's all sustainably sourced."`,"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.food-drink-quote-2"\:`"I travel a lot\\u2014don't know what I'd do if I couldn't power my day with their coffee."`,"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.food-drink-quote-3"\:`"I'm serious about my coffee. I'm glad they take it seriously too, while having fun with it."`,"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.ftux-button"\:"Add","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.ftux-info"\:"Upload images and add descriptive text for this section","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.ftux-label"\:"Add group","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.group-item-duplicate"\:"Duplicate","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.group-item-remove"\:"Remove","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.group-label"\:"Group","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.health-beauty-attribution-1"\:"Sasha, 26, Philadelphia","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.health-beauty-attribution-2"\:"Jorge, 32, Brooklyn","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.health-beauty-attribution-3"\:"Jenny, 40, Boston","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.health-beauty-quote"\:`"I swear by these products. Sometimes I don't know if my skin or my mind needs them more."`,"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.health-beauty-quote-2"\:'"I bought these for my partner but I found myself ordering replacements\\u2014they really work!"',"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.health-beauty-quote-3"\:`"With all the skincare out there, I'm so glad I found feel-good products that really work."`,"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.home-living-attribution-1"\:"Janice, 36, Boston","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.home-living-attribution-2"\:"Steven, 27, Seattle","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.home-living-attribution-3"\:"Gigi, 25, Charleston","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.home-living-quote"\:'"Pleasantly surprised by the quality you get without emptying your wallet."',"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.home-living-quote-2"\:'"Every piece feels like I hand picked them right from their woodshop\\u2014all are unique."',"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.home-living-quote-3"\:`"I've been looking to get some adult furniture for once and I couldn't be happier."`,"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.image-label"\:"Image","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.jewelry-accessories-attribution-1"\:"Julie, 30, Nashville","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.jewelry-accessories-attribution-2"\:"Seth, 34, Chicago","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.jewelry-accessories-attribution-3"\:"Denise, 22, San Jose","purposes.repeatable-testimonial.jewelry-accessories-quote"\:`"I've been looking for jewelry that's both understated and elegant. I'm definitely a fan."`,"purposes.repeatable-testimonial.jewelry-accessories-quote-2"\:'"All high quality and well made. I love how affordable they are for 